# Rembrio uses one env file per app. Copy these and fill them in:
#   server/.env.example  ->  server/.env      (secrets: MongoDB, JWT, Gemini)   REQUIRED
#   client/.env.example  ->  client/.env      (optional: only for a separately hosted API)
#
# PowerShell:
#   Copy-Item server\.env.example server\.env
#
# Never commit a real .env file. Gemini and MongoDB credentials belong ONLY in server/.env.
